furthermore, &lt;style&gt; blocks are easy to extend to media-specific, device-specific, and alternative-stylesheet-specific cases, which is not the case at all for attributes.
we want to encourage good authoring practices.
that shouldn't really, age: age, age: i'm ."}"")
